stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ResolveMember: dev_idx 查找
  ResolveMember --> TryReadRef: 读取请求
  ResolveMember --> TryWriteRef: 写入请求

  TryReadRef --> ReadHeld: 已获取 io_ref[READ]
  TryReadRef --> Failed: 设备缺失 / 引用繁忙

  TryWriteRef --> CheckRwState: 已获取 io_ref[WRITE]
  CheckRwState --> WriteHeld: 成员_state == rw
  CheckRwState --> Failed: 只读 / 驱逐中 / 备用

  ReadHeld --> OnlineCheck
  OnlineCheck --> UsableRead: 设备在线
  OnlineCheck --> Failed: 引用后设备缺失

  WriteHeld --> UsableWrite
  UsableRead --> [*]
  UsableWrite --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
